# Library of Leng offers nothing for a card discarded to pay a cost. Psychic Frog's "Discard a card:" is a cost Bot1 pays
# activating it, not an effect (the rulings: "costs aren't effects"), so the Island goes to the graveyard and no question is
# asked. Steamcore Scholar's "discard two cards unless you discard an instant or sorcery card" is paid with the Lightning
# Bolt, a discard that must be a card with a named characteristic: put into the library unrevealed it could not pay that
# (CR 701.9c), so the Library is not offered for it (the owner's ruling) and it goes to the graveyard.
[Bot1 Deck]
Library of Leng
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Psychic Frog
Black Lotus
Steamcore Scholar
Island
Lightning Bolt
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

